<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 93 0 R
/E (Engagement with Indigenous knowledge also changed how Raphael viewed marine biomass, not simply as waste to be managed, but as part of a broader ecological and cultural system. This perspective encouraged approaches based on stewardship, minimal disturbance, reciprocal benefit, and low-impact extraction, while considering how the resulting biostimulants could contribute to local food systems.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
