/P 93 0 R
/E (In this issue of the MBI Newsletter, we are featuring two researchers from Work Package 4 of the MBI project whose work demonstrates how community knowledge, local priorities, and scientific research can come together through Etuaptmumk \(Two-Eyed Seeing\).)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
