272 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E (Her research focuses on developing a carbon nanofertilizer from lobster shell waste. Lobster shells were sourced from four Indigenous communities, Flat Bay Band, Bay St. George Band, Three Rivers Band, and Benoit First Nation Band, where families already use shell waste as a nutrient for gardens. Rather than treating this existing practice as separate from the scientific research, Ayesha incorporated it directly into her experimental design as the control treatment.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
