<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E (One highlight has been co-developing school demonstrations and community garden initiatives, where researchers, youth, community members, and Chiefs have worked together to explore how locally available marine materials can benefit plants and soils.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
